- `Get-WReparseStats` counted every non-`File` record as a directory *and* as a reparse point, breaking mutual exclusivity (§3.3). Now `Directory`/`File`/`ReparsePoint` are counted exclusively so the three sum to the record count.
- `Sort-WReparseStable` gained a tie-break selector, so `Errors` are stably sorted by `RelativePath` then `Code` (§6.3), while `Records` keep the ordinal-ignore-case primary / ordinal tie-break (§6.1). The merge sort remains culture-independent.
- `Get-WReparseReport` now sorts errors correctly and reuses the walk's canonical root.
